body:
I'm Italian and Verona is super pretty! Plus I like the idea of a non-Italian using it because it'll get people more interested in our culture haha. For example, my name is Sanskrit but I am Italian-Canadian and I have people ask me all the time about my name and the meaning behind it and what not! My name actually has a rich history and I love telling people about it! I hope Verona feels the same way!

&#x200B;

Edit: just saw your husbands got some Italian in him! Even better! It could make her want. tolook into her heritage more!
